  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Xét <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (đường chéo các mặt hình vuông trong hình lập phương).<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đều <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/1cc16628cafe64b39297e6ec45ac4a92a33ec470c77284ec5a3dbbcdee7847bd.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
